"about.credits" = "Your personal cinema. Right at home on your Mac.\nSwift · AppKit · AVKit · libmpv\n\nAn independent Emby client, not affiliated with Emby.";
"help.title" = "Your next great story starts here.";
"help.body" = "Press ⌘K to connect to your Emby server.\nDouble-click a poster or press Return for details. Press Space to play.\nUse ⌘F to search, ⌘R to refresh, and ⌘1–4 to switch libraries.\n\nMP4 uses the system player. MKV and other formats play directly within Luma. Use Space to pause, the arrow keys to seek, and ⌃⌘F for full screen. Audio tracks, subtitles, playback speed, and media keys are supported. The system player also supports Picture in Picture.\n\nWhen disconnected, Luma shows fictional preview titles. Playback uses the Sintel sample film.";
